[
  {
    "_id": "69a5b38c49a54edb69d22880",
    "moduleId": "69a5b3884c3ac66e63aa196e",
    "order": 1,
    "__v": 0,
    "createdAt": "2026-03-02T15:58:00.983Z",
    "description": "We learn what a computer actually is and how it takes in information, thinks about it, and gives us a result. We also learn the difference between the physical machine you can touch (hardware) and the invisible instructions that make it work (software).",
    "notesPath": null,
    "quiz": null,
    "title": "Introduction to Computers",
    "youtubeURL": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/zO-7lJTYUcg"
  },
  {
    "_id": "69a5b38c49a54edb69d22881",
    "moduleId": "69a5b3884c3ac66e63aa196e",
    "order": 2,
    "__v": 0,
    "createdAt": "2026-03-02T15:58:01.044Z",
    "description": "We look inside the computer to understand how it works. We learn about its \"brain\" (the processor), its short-term memory (RAM), and its long-term storage (the Hard Drive).",
    "notesPath": null,
    "quiz": null,
    "title": "Core Components",
    "youtubeURL": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/kVudR7sxdYY"
  },
  {
    "_id": "69a5b38c49a54edb69d22882",
    "moduleId": "69a5b3884c3ac66e63aa196e",
    "order": 3,
    "__v": 0,
    "createdAt": "2026-03-02T15:58:01.108Z",
    "description": "We meet the \"manager\" of the computer (Windows 11). We learn how to turn the computer on, log in safely, and find our way around the main screen and basic menus.",
    "notesPath": null,
    "quiz": null,
    "title": "The Operating System (System Software)",
    "youtubeURL": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/kAQJ_xaHAHk"
  },
  {
    "_id": "69a5b38c49a54edb69d22883",
    "moduleId": "69a5b3884c3ac66e63aa196e",
    "order": 4,
    "__v": 0,
    "createdAt": "2026-03-02T15:58:01.161Z",
    "description": "We learn how to organize our digital life. We practice making folders, naming files so they make sense, and moving things around safely so we never lose our hard work.",
    "notesPath": null,
    "quiz": null,
    "title": "File Management",
    "youtubeURL": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/2lOtuFzqBJg"
  },
  {
    "_id": "69a5b38c49a54edb69d22884",
    "moduleId": "69a5b3884c3ac66e63aa196e",
    "order": 5,
    "__v": 0,
    "createdAt": "2026-03-02T15:58:01.225Z",
    "description": "We learn how to safely plug things into the computer, like mice, keyboards, and screens. We also learn how to connect wireless tools (like headphones) and how to safely remove USB drives without breaking them.",
    "notesPath": null,
    "quiz": null,
    "title": "Peripherals and Ports",
    "youtubeURL": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/dTWZN2wbXx0"
  },
  {
    "_id": "69a5b38c49a54edb69d22885",
    "moduleId": "69a5b3884c3ac66e63aa196e",
    "order": 6,
    "__v": 0,
    "createdAt": "2026-03-02T15:58:01.288Z",
    "description": "We discover how to find and safely install the specific programs we need to do our work, like writing tools or web browsers. We also learn how to spot fake download buttons so we don't accidentally download viruses.",
    "notesPath": null,
    "quiz": null,
    "title": "Application Software",
    "youtubeURL": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/dTWZN2wbXx0"
  },
  {
    "_id": "69a5b38d49a54edb69d22886",
    "moduleId": "69a5b3884c3ac66e63aa196e",
    "order": 7,
    "__v": 0,
    "createdAt": "2026-03-02T15:58:01.361Z",
    "description": "We learn what to do when the computer freezes or acts up. We cover simple, safe steps to fix everyday problems without panicking or having to call an expensive expert.",
    "notesPath": null,
    "quiz": null,
    "title": "The Boot Process & Troubleshooting",
    "youtubeURL": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/fVK97_cNsF0"
  },
  {
    "_id": "69a5b38d49a54edb69d22887",
    "moduleId": "69a5b3884c3ac66e63aa196e",
    "order": 8,
    "__v": 0,
    "createdAt": "2026-03-02T15:58:01.417Z",
    "description": "We learn the difference between programs installed directly on the computer and programs we use over the internet. We also learn how to stop annoying \"junk\" software from sneaking onto our computer and slowing it down.",
    "notesPath": null,
    "quiz": null,
    "title": "Software and Application",
    "youtubeURL": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/ksyfodbL9gU"
  },
  {
    "_id": "69a5b38d49a54edb69d22888",
    "moduleId": "69a5b3884c3ac66e63aa196e",
    "order": 9,
    "__v": 0,
    "createdAt": "2026-03-02T15:58:01.474Z",
    "description": "We focus on keeping the physical machine clean and cool so it lasts a long time. More importantly, we learn how to sit and look at the screen correctly so our backs, necks, and eyes stay healthy.",
    "notesPath": null,
    "quiz": null,
    "title": "Computer Care & Safety",
    "youtubeURL": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/E3X0JsuhSeY"
  },
  {
    "_id": "69a5b38d49a54edb69d22889",
    "moduleId": "69a5b3884c3ac66e63aa196e",
    "order": 10,
    "__v": 0,
    "createdAt": "2026-03-02T15:58:01.526Z",
    "description": "This is a hands-on test where students take the driver's seat. Students will prove they can use all the skills they learned in the first nine lessons to solve real-world tasks with confidence.",
    "notesPath": null,
    "quiz": null,
    "title": "Practical Lab",
    "youtubeURL": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/bu-vlh2gg-I"
  },
  {
    "_id": "69acc4dab8f95ca598f9768d",
    "moduleId": "69a6d7f3258e2632ad6e3719",
    "title": "Lesson 1: Understanding Files and Folders",
    "youtubeURL": "https://youtu.be/ICdLb8Ppd9Y?si=bF3Xmz6wZluTk35r",
    "description": "In this video, we learn the basics of keeping your computer organized. We will look at the difference between \"Files\" (the actual documents and pictures you make) and \"Folders\" (the containers that hold your work). We will also explain what \"The Cloud\" is in a very simple way, so you can understand how your important work stays safe and backed up on the internet.",
    "notesPath": "1772988761566-523803146.pdf",
    "quiz": null,
    "order": 1,
    "createdAt": "2026-03-08T00:37:46.552Z",
    "__v": 0
  },
  {
    "_id": "69ad76b9aaea755878fe9d85",
    "moduleId": "69a6d7f3258e2632ad6e3719",
    "title": "The Windows File Explorer",
    "youtubeURL": "https://youtu.be/4doy6JiE_QM?si=O9wf_GVfUi6FV309",
    "description": "se the left-hand menu to jump around, how to change the way your files look (from big pictures to detailed lists), and how to \"pin\" your favorite folders so they are always just one click away.",
    "notesPath": null,
    "quiz": null,
