  {
    "_id": "69aea915aaea755878fecb62",
    "moduleId": "69a6d7f3258e2632ad6e3719",
    "title": "Creating, Naming, and Renaming",
    "youtubeURL": "https://youtu.be/zLoX-1CBAv8?si=uT1VPQXmP4Bw7jCI",
    "description": "What is in a name? A lot! In this lesson, we learn the professional way to name our files so they sort themselves perfectly. We will explain why you cannot use certain symbols, why putting the date in the name matters, and the fastest keyboard trick (the F2 key) to rename your work in a flash.",
    "notesPath": null,
    "quiz": null,
    "order": 3,
    "createdAt": "2026-03-09T11:03:49.606Z",
    "__v": 0
  },
  {
    "_id": "69b14b4daaea755878fee6c3",
    "moduleId": "69a6d7f3258e2632ad6e3719",
    "title": "Managing Data, Copying Moving, and Deleting",
    "youtubeURL": "https://youtu.be/jajmR4RTppY?si=ukrmsnQObdC0USfn",
    "description": "Now that we have files, it is time to move them around. We will clearly explain the difference between \"Copying\" (making a duplicate) and \"Cutting\" (moving the original). We will practice dragging files across the screen and show you how the Recycle Bin acts as a safety net if you ever delete something by mistake.",
    "notesPath": null,
    "quiz": null,
    "order": 4,
    "createdAt": "2026-03-11T11:00:29.388Z",
    "__v": 0
  },
  {
