    "moduleId": "69a6d7f3258e2632ad6e3719",
    "title": "File Extensions and File Types",
    "youtubeURL": "https://youtu.be/o2yeCkVaiXU",
    "description": "Have you ever noticed the little letters at the end of a file name, like .pdf or .jpg? These are called \"extensions,\" and they are the secret codes that tell your computer which app to use. In this video, we will unhide these codes, learn what they mean, and see how to change which program opens your files.",
